; The SSG's hardware envelope: :env picks its shape, 8 and 12 saws, 10 and 14
; triangles, and :env-rate note runs it at the note's pitch. With :mode env
; the envelope is the sound: a buzz.
; Try: make it a triangle (:env 10).
(def-score :target pc88)
(sqr1 :env 8 :env-rate note :mode env :oct 3 c2 g2)
